B.arQ=new A.h("\n\nThe purpose of this documentation is to outline the legal and technical framework governing Software Bills of Materials (SBOMs) and Vulnerability Exploitability Exchange (VEX). It incorporates key recitals from Regulation (EU) 2024/2847, guidelines from CISA and ENISA, and major technical standards such as CycloneDX and SPDX.",!1,!1,!1,null)
