B.asA=new A.h("Annex I, Part II of Regulation (EU) 2024/2847 (Cyber Resilience Act)",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ard=new A.h(" \u2014 The obligation to create an SBOM is found under Vulnerability handling requirements. This part mandates that manufacturers must identify components and draw up a machine-readable SBOM. Under EU-type examination, a notified body examines the technical design, development, and vulnerability handling processes to attest that the product meets essential cybersecurity requirements.",!1,!1,!1,null)
