B.asF=new A.h(" \u201cServices\u201d means the services and products provided to Customer by Company in accordance with the Agreements.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a9W=s([B.ass,B.asF],t.c)
B.aiH=new A.Y(B.a9W)
B.Xz=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 3. Processing of Personal Data on behalf of a Customer")
B.apX=new A.h("The Parties acknowledge and agree that with regard to the Processing of Personal Data performed solely on behalf of Customer: (i) Customer is the Controller or Business (to the extent the CCPA is applicable) of Personal Data; (ii) Company acts as a Processor or Service Provider (to the extent the CCPA is applicable) for Customer, and upon the instructions of Customer, as set forth herein, and in the Agreements, as may be amended from time to time by Company (collectively, the \u201cTerms\u201c), pursuant to which personal data may be disclosed to Company and Company may process such personal data (the \u201cContracted Business Purpose\u201d).",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a2v=s([B.apX],t.c)
B.ajz=new A.Y(B.a2v)
B.Xy=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 4. Customer Representations")
B.apH=new A.h("Customer sets forth the details, including the purpose, the means and the ways in which Company shall process the Customer Data, as required by Applicable Data Protection Laws in Appendix A (Details of Processing of Processed Personal Data), attached hereto, and Customer represents and warrants that:",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a85=s([B.apH],t.c)
B.aif=new A.Y(B.a85)
B.asc=new A.h("4.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.avt=new A.h(" It complies with personal data security and other obligations prescribed by Applicable Data Protection Laws for controller/businesses, and that the provision of Customer Data to Company complies with Applicable Data Protection Laws;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a1P=s([B.asc,B.avt],t.c)
B.aqr=new A.h("4.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arc=new A.h(" It only processes personal data/personal information that has been collected in accordance with the Applicable Data Protection Laws;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a3x=s([B.aqr,B.arc],t.c)
B.avd=new A.h("4.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aph=new A.h(" It has in place procedures in case individuals/consumers whose personal data is collected, wish to exercise their rights in accordance with the Applicable Data Protection Laws;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a5J=s([B.avd,B.aph],t.c)
B.auz=new A.h("4.4.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arB=new A.h(" It provides Customer Data to Company for a business purpose in accordance with the representations Customer makes to consumers in Customer\u2019s privacy policy, and Customer does not sell Customer Data to Company;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a9y=s([B.auz,B.arB],t.c)
B.aoh=new A.h("4.5.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aoJ=new A.h(" It shall provide to Company as a processor/service provider, or otherwise have Company (or anyone on its behalf) process such Customer Data which is explicitly permitted under Company\u2019s PN (\u201cPermitted Personal Data\u201c). Solely Customer shall be liable for any data which is made available to Company in excess of the Permitted Personal Data (\u201cNon-Permitted Data\u201d). Company\u2019s obligations under the Terms shall not apply to any such Non-Permitted Data;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a53=s([B.aoh,B.aoJ],t.c)
B.auc=new A.h("4.6.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.apA=new A.h(" It is and will remain duly and effectively authorized to give the instruction set out herein and any additional instructions as provided pursuant to the Terms, at all relevant times and at least for as long as the Terms are in effect and for any additional period during which Company is lawfully processing personal data/personal information;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a2K=s([B.auc,B.apA],t.c)
B.aq3=new A.h("4.7.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arv=new A.h(" Notwithstanding anything to the contrary herein, Customer acknowledges that Company is able to access Customer Data, and might do so when required for operational and maintenance purposes and if required to provide the Services.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a1E=s([B.aq3,B.arv],t.c)
B.a_r=s([B.a1P,B.a3x,B.a5J,B.a9y,B.a53,B.a2K,B.a1E],t.a)
B.MI=new A.di(B.a_r)
B.X9=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 5. Company Obligations")
B.arx=new A.h("5.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arf=new A.h(" Company carries out the processing of Customer Data on Customer\u2019s behalf;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.abD=s([B.arx,B.arf],t.c)
B.atv=new A.h("5.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.avL=new A.h(" Pursuant to the provisions of Article 28 of the GDPR, Company represents and warrants that it will:",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a8L=s([B.atv,B.avL],t.c)
B.auI=new A.h("5.2.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ars=new A.h(" Process Customer Data solely on Customer\u2019s behalf and in compliance with User\u2019s instructions (including relating to international data transfers), including instructions in this DPA and all Terms, unless required to do so by EU or applicable Member State law;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a9Q=s([B.auI,B.ars],t.c)
B.aoR=new A.h("5.2.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aq9=new A.h(" Implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to provide an appropriate level of security, including, as appropriate and applicable, the measures referred to in Article 32(1) of the GDPR;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.abp=s([B.aoR,B.aq9],t.c)
B.asz=new A.h("5.2.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arn=new A.h(" Take reasonable steps to ensure that access to the processed Customer Data is limited on a need to know/access basis, and that all Company personnel receiving such access are subject to confidentiality undertakings or professional or statutory obligations of confidentiality in connection with their access/use of Customer Data.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.aa7=s([B.asz,B.arn],t.c)
B.atk=new A.h("5.2.4.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.atf=new A.h(" It shall provide reasonable assistance to Customer with any data protection impact assessments or prior consultations with supervising authorities in relation to processing of Customer Data by the processor/service provider, as required under any Applicable Data Protection Laws, at the written request of the Customer, and at Customer\u2019s sole expense.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.abI=s([B.atk,B.atf],t.c)
B.avv=new A.h("5.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arH=new A.h(" Pursuant to the CCPA, to the extent applicable with respect to each data subject, Company agrees that:",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a7q=s([B.avv,B.arH],t.c)
B.auG=new A.h("5.3.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.atD=new A.h(" Company is acting solely as a service provider with respect to Customer Data for the purposes of the Contracted Business Purpose;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.ad6=s([B.auG,B.atD],t.c)
B.aqb=new A.h("5.3.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.apj=new A.h(" Company shall not retain, use or disclose Customer Data for any purpose other than for the Contracted Business Purpose;",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a_X=s([B.aqb,B.apj],t.c)
B.atR=new A.h("5.3.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aom=new A.h(" Company may de-identify or aggregate Customer Data as part of performing the services specified in the Terms.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a4H=s([B.atR,B.aom],t.c)
B.asJ=new A.h("5.3.4.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arA=new A.h(" Company will limit personal information collection, use, retention, and disclosure to activities reasonably necessary and proportionate to achieve the Contracted Business Purposes or another compatible operational purpose.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a7o=s([B.asJ,B.arA],t.c)
B.a1a=s([B.abD,B.a8L,B.a9Q,B.abp,B.aa7,B.abI,B.a7q,B.ad6,B.a_X,B.a4H,B.a7o],t.a)
B.Mx=new A.di(B.a1a)
B.Xh=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 6. Sub-Processing")
B.arZ=new A.h("6.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.asa=new A.h(" Customer authorizes Company to appoint sub-processors in accordance with the provision of the Terms. Any subcontractor used must qualify as a service provider under the Applicable Data Protection Laws. Company cannot make any disclosures to the subcontractor that the CCPA would treat as a sale.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a5z=s([B.arZ,B.asa],t.c)
B.auH=new A.h("6.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ar5=new A.h(" Company may continue to use those sub-processors already engaged by Company as of the date of this DPA. Customer acknowledges and agrees that as of the date of this DPA Company uses certain sub-processors; a list of such sub-processors will be provided upon request.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a5V=s([B.auH,B.ar5],t.c)
B.arL=new A.h("6.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.atB=new A.h(" Company may appoint new sub-processors and shall give reasonable notice of the appointment of any new sub-processor. Customer\u2019s continued use of the applicable services after such notification constitutes Customer\u2019s acceptance of the new sub-processor.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a4q=s([B.arL,B.atB],t.c)
B.ack=s([B.a5z,B.a5V,B.a4q],t.a)
B.MA=new A.di(B.ack)
B.WR=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 7. Data Subjects\u2019 Rights")
B.aqK=new A.h("7.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.avS=new A.h(" Customer shall be solely responsible for compliance with any statutory obligations concerning requests to exercise data subject rights under Applicable Data Protection Laws (e.g., for access, rectification, deletion of processed Customer Data, etc.). Company shall reasonably endeavor to assist Customer insofar as feasible, to fulfil Customer\u2019s said obligations with respect to such data subject requests, as applicable, at Customer\u2019s sole reasonable expense.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.YT=s([B.aqK,B.avS],t.c)
B.aug=new A.h("7.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aqi=new A.h(" Company shall (i) without undue delay notify customer if it receives a request from a data subject under any Applicable Data Protection Laws in respect of Processed Personal Data; and (ii) not respond to that request, except on the written instructions of Customer or as required by Applicable Data Protection Laws, in which case Company shall, to the extent permitted by Applicable Data Protection Laws, inform controller/business of that legal requirement before it responds to the request.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a3y=s([B.aug,B.aqi],t.c)
B.a5h=s([B.YT,B.a3y],t.a)
B.ML=new A.di(B.a5h)
B.WY=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 8. Personal Data Breach")
B.atZ=new A.h("8.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.av7=new A.h(" Company shall notify Customer without undue delay upon Company becoming aware of any personal data breach within the meaning of Applicable Data Protection Laws relating to Customer Data which may require a notification to be made to a supervisory authority or data subject under Applicable Data Protection Laws (\u201cPersonal Data Breach\u201c).",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a21=s([B.atZ,B.av7],t.c)
B.avz=new A.h("8.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.at_=new A.h(" At the written request of the Customer and at Customer\u2019s sole expense, Company shall provide reasonable co-operation and assistance to Customer in respect of Customer\u2019s obligations regarding the investigation of any Personal Data Breach and the notification to the supervisory authority and data subjects in respect of such a Personal Data Breach; provided, however, that Company shall, at its own expense, use reasonable efforts to contain and remedy any Personal Data Breach caused by Company (or its agents, representatives, or subcontractors) without undue delay and prevent any further Personal Data Breach, including, but not limited to taking any and all reasonable action necessary to comply with Applicable Data Protection Laws.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.acZ=s([B.avz,B.at_],t.c)
B.a0V=s([B.a21,B.acZ],t.a)
B.MP=new A.di(B.a0V)
B.WL=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 9. Deletion or Return of Processed Personal Data")
B.arY=new A.h("9.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.avc=new A.h(" Subject to the terms hereof, Company shall within up to sixty (60) days, unless a sooner time period is required by Applicable Data Protection Laws, return and then destroy the Customer Data, except such copies as authorized including under this DPA or required to be retained in accordance with Applicable Data Protection Laws.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a2I=s([B.arY,B.avc],t.c)
B.aty=new A.h("9.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.auW=new A.h(" Company may retain Customer Data only to the extent authorized or required by Applicable Data Protection Laws, provided that Company shall ensure the confidentiality of such Customer Data and shall ensure that it is only processed for such legal purpose(s). The provisions of this DPA shall govern any such retained Customer Data.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.ZA=s([B.aty,B.auW],t.c)
B.aqI=new A.h("9.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.atO=new A.h(" Upon Customer\u2019s prior written request, Company shall provide written certification to Customer that it has complied with this Section 9.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a0U=s([B.aqI,B.atO],t.c)
B.a5x=s([B.a2I,B.ZA,B.a0U],t.a)
B.MM=new A.di(B.a5x)
B.WQ=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 10. Audit Rights")
B.as5=new A.h("10.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.as6=new A.h(" Subject to the terms hereof, and not more than once in each calendar year, Company shall make available to a reputable auditor mandated by Customer in coordination with Company, at the reasonable cost of the Customer upon prior written request, within normal business hours at Company premises, such information necessary and relevant to reasonably demonstrate compliance with this DPA, and shall allow for audits by such reputable auditor mandated by the Customer in relation to the processing of the Customer Data by Company, provided that such third-party auditor shall be subject to confidentiality obligations.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a8Q=s([B.as5,B.as6],t.c)
B.asu=new A.h("10.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.at2=new A.h(" Customer shall use (and ensure that each of its mandated auditors use) its best efforts to avoid causing (or, if it cannot avoid, to minimize) any damage, injury or disruption to Company\u2019s premises, equipment, personnel and business while its personnel are on those premises in the course of such an audit or inspection.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a37=s([B.asu,B.at2],t.c)
B.a5N=s([B.a8Q,B.a37],t.a)
B.MJ=new A.di(B.a5N)
B.Xv=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 11. International Data Transfers")
B.aol=new A.h("11.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ap2=new A.h(" Customer may select the datacenters locations as offered by Company where Customer Data will be processed. Once Customer has made its choice, Company will not transfer Customer Data from Customer\u2019s selected locations, except as necessary to provide the Services initiated by Customer, or as specifically required by the Customer, or as necessary to comply with applicable law.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a_T=s([B.aol,B.ap2],t.c)
B.aok=new A.h("11.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.atn=new A.h(" Subject to Section 11.1, Personal Data may be transferred from the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom (\u201cUK\u201d) to countries that offer an adequate level of data protection under or pursuant to the adequacy decisions, as determined by the European Commission pursuant to Article 45 of GDPR, and by the Secretary of State, pursuant to Section 17A of the United Kingdom Data Protection Act 2018, respectively, or other adequate authority, as determined by the EU (\u201cAdequacy Decisions\u201d), as applicable, without any further safeguard being necessary.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a3U=s([B.aok,B.atn],t.c)
B.aud=new A.h("11.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.atF=new A.h(" To the extent that Company transfers (either directly or via onward transfer) Personal Data to countries outside of the European Economic Area and/or outside of the UK, which have not been subject to a relevant Adequacy Decision, or such transfers are not performed through an alternative recognized compliance mechanism as may be adopted by Company for the lawful transfer of Personal Data (as set out under the GDPR), and to the extent applicable with respect to each data subject, such transfer of Customer\u2019s Personal Data to other countries, shall be subject, where the application of such SCCs, as between the parties, is required under Applicable Data Protection Laws, to the Standard Contractual Clauses, as such are incorporated into this DPA by reference, and shall be implemented as follows:",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.ab5=s([B.aud,B.atF],t.c)
B.aqn=new A.h("11.3.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.av8=new A.h(" In the case of transfer of Personal Data between Customer to Company, the parties shall implement Module II \u2013 \u201cController to Processor\u201d, of the Standard Contractual Clauses, with modifications detailed under this Section 11.3.2. However, when Customer is acting as a processor Module III (\u201cProcessor-to-Processor\u201d) shall apply, provided that, taking into account the nature of the processing, Customer agrees that it is unlikely that Company will know the identity of Customer\u2019s controllers, as Company has no direct relationship with Customer\u2019s controllers and therefore, Customer will fulfil Company\u2019s obligations to Customer\u2019s controllers under the Processor-to-Processor SCCs.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a13=s([B.aqn,B.av8],t.c)
B.aqo=new A.h("11.3.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ar8=new A.h(" The parties are deemed to have accepted and executed the SCCs, including the associated annexes. The contents of Annex I of the SCCs are included within Appendix A to this DPA. The contents of Annex II of the SCCs are included within Appendix B to this DPA. The parties further agree to the following implementation choices under the SCCs:",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a3s=s([B.aqo,B.ar8],t.c)
B.at4=new A.h("11.3.2.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ato=new A.h(" Clause 7: shall not be applicable.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a5C=s([B.at4,B.ato],t.c)
B.at5=new A.h("11.3.2.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ap0=new A.h(" Clause 9(a): The parties choose Option 2, \u201cGeneral Written Authorization\u201d and specify a time period of thirty (30) days.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a7m=s([B.at5,B.ap0],t.c)
B.at6=new A.h("11.3.2.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.av4=new A.h(" Clause 11: The parties choose not to include the optional language relating to the use of an independent dispute resolution body.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.ZI=s([B.at6,B.av4],t.c)
B.at7=new A.h("11.3.2.4.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arK=new A.h(" Clause 17: The parties select Option 1 and specify the law of [Governing Law State/Country].",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a0t=s([B.at7,B.arK],t.c)
B.at8=new A.h("11.3.2.5.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aqM=new A.h(" Clause 18(b): The parties specify the courts of [City/Jurisdiction].",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a_h=s([B.at8,B.aqM],t.c)
B.aqp=new A.h("11.3.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.av2=new A.h(" In the case of transfer of Personal Data between Company and its Sub-Processors for the purposes of carrying out specific Processing activities (on behalf of Customer) the Parties will enter into Module III (\u201cProcessor-to-Processor\u201d) of the Standard Contractual Clauses.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a6C=s([B.aqp,B.av2],t.c)
B.ave=new A.h("11.4.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aoX=new A.h(" Appendixes A and B, attached to this DPA shall also apply in connection with the processing of Personal Data, subject to Applicable Data Protection Law.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a5O=s([B.ave,B.aoX],t.c)
B.auP=new A.h("11.5.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aox=new A.h(" Company reserves the right to adopt an alternative compliance standard to the SCCs for the lawful transfer of Personal Data, provided it is recognized under Data Protection Law. Company will provide 30 days\u2019 advance notice of its adoption of an alternative compliance standard.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.aac=s([B.auP,B.aox],t.c)
B.a16=s([B.a_T,B.a3U,B.ab5,B.a13,B.a3s,B.a5C,B.a7m,B.ZI,B.a0t,B.a_h,B.a6C,B.a5O,B.aac],t.a)
B.My=new A.di(B.a16)
B.WU=new A.b3(2,"\xa7 12. General Terms")
B.aqa=new A.h("12.1. Governing Law and Jurisdiction.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.arw=new A.h(" All disputes with respect to this DPA shall be determined in accordance with the laws of [Governing Law State/Country] and shall be handled at a competent court in [City/Jurisdiction].",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a26=s([B.aqa,B.arw],t.c)
B.aq5=new A.h("12.2. Conflict.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ape=new A.h(" In the event of any conflict or inconsistency between this DPA and any other agreements between the parties, including agreements entered into after the date of this DPA, the provisions of this DPA shall prevail.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a48=s([B.aq5,B.ape],t.c)
B.avg=new A.h("12.3. Changes in Applicable Data Protection Laws.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.apQ=new A.h(" Company may by at least forty-five (45) calendar days\u2019 prior written notice to Customer, request in writing any changes to this DPA, if they are required, as a result of any change in any Applicable Data Protection Law, regarding the lawfulness of the processing of Customer Data. If Customer provides its modification request, Company shall make commercially reasonable efforts to accommodate such modification request, and Customer shall not unreasonably withhold or delay agreement to any consequential changes to this DPA to protect Company against any additional risks, and/or to indemnify and compensate Company for any further costs associated with the changes made hereunder.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a2R=s([B.avg,B.apQ],t.c)
B.apz=new A.h("12.4. Severance.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.apG=new A.h(" Should any provision of this DPA be invalid or unenforceable, then the remainder of this DPA shall remain valid and in force. The invalid or unenforceable provision shall either be (i) amended as necessary to ensure its validity and enforceability, while preserving the parties\u2019 intentions as closely as possible or, if this is not possible, (ii) construed in a manner as if the invalid or unenforceable part had never been contained therein.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a9B=s([B.apz,B.apG],t.c)
